        "original_id": "ea507835-2658-5991-a5f4-d5463d8d63b5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Faxe, Faxe Municipality, Region Zealand, Denmark\n- Companies: Faxe Bryggeri\n- Topics: Danish administrative regions, 2007 Danish Municipal Reform\n\nFacts:\n- Region Zealand is the southernmost administrative region of Denmark.\n- Region Zealand was established on January 1, 2007 as part of the 2007 Danish Municipal Reform.\n- The 2007 Danish Municipal Reform replaced Denmark’s traditional counties with five larger regions.\n- Faxe is located in Faxe Municipality in Region Zealand.\n- Faxe is most known for Faxe Bryggeri, a relatively large brewery that produces beer and soft drinks.",
